sequenceDiagram
    participant Client as External Client
    participant Gateway as Platform Gateway<br/>(rhods-operator)<br/>HTTPRoute/Route
    participant KServe as KServe<br/>InferenceService
    participant API as vLLM API Server<br/>8000/TCP HTTP
    participant Auth as AuthenticationMiddleware<br/>Bearer Token (SHA256)
    participant RustFE as Rust Frontend (vllm-rs)<br/>Tokenizer + Chat Template
    participant Scheduler as Continuous Batching<br/>Scheduler
    participant Engine as vLLM Engine Core<br/>PyTorch CPU
    participant ModelFS as Model Weights<br/>(PVC / Local FS)
    participant HFHub as HuggingFace Hub<br/>443/TCP HTTPS
    participant Prom as Prometheus
    participant OTel as OpenTelemetry Collector<br/>4317/TCP gRPC

    Note over Client,OTel: Flow 1: Model Inference Request

    Client->>Gateway: POST /v1/chat/completions<br/>HTTPS (TLS terminated at Gateway)
    Gateway->>API: HTTP/8000<br/>Platform-managed auth
    API->>Auth: Validate Bearer Token<br/>(if --api-key configured)
    Auth-->>API: Authenticated
    API->>RustFE: Tokenize input +<br/>Render chat template
    RustFE-->>API: Token IDs
    API->>Scheduler: Enqueue request
    Scheduler->>Engine: Batched inference step<br/>(continuous batching)
    Engine->>ModelFS: Read model weights<br/>(File I/O)
    ModelFS-->>Engine: Weight tensors
    Note over Engine: CPU inference<br/>AVX2/AVX512 kernels<br/>KV cache management
    Engine-->>Scheduler: Generated tokens
    Scheduler-->>API: Streaming / complete response
    API->>RustFE: Parse tool calls /<br/>reasoning (if applicable)
    RustFE-->>API: Parsed output
    API-->>Gateway: JSON Response (SSE if streaming)
    Gateway-->>Client: Response

    Note over Client,OTel: Flow 2: Model Download (Startup)

    API->>HFHub: GET model weights<br/>HTTPS/443 TLS 1.2+<br/>Auth: Bearer Token (HF_TOKEN)
    HFHub-->>API: Model artifacts<br/>(safetensors / GPTQ / AWQ)
    API->>ModelFS: Cache to local filesystem / PVC

    Note over Client,OTel: Flow 3: Observability

    Prom->>API: GET /metrics<br/>HTTP/8000 (no auth)
    API-->>Prom: Prometheus metrics<br/>(inference latency, throughput, KV cache usage)
    API->>OTel: OTLP traces<br/>gRPC/4317 (insecure default)
